# PROMPT 001 — Master Context (Mentrixa final build)

Production app: **mentrixa.one**. This is the legit final version, built around one identity. Read every constraint before writing code.

## The identity

Every screen answers one question: **what is true about me right now that was not true yesterday, compared to someone real.** This is not a tagline. It governs every UI decision.

## The mechanic

**Verified First Attempt.** The first time a user sees a question from a given skill node, that result is permanent and is the only thing counting toward rank. One unique constraint on `(user_id, skill_node_id)` in `verified_first_attempts`, enforced server side, zero exceptions. Practice after first encounter never moves rank.

## The one skill

**AP Calculus AB only.** Practice picker scoped to it exclusively until a second subject passes the same bar: real skill tree, reviewed item bank, sufficient first attempt volume for a real percentile.

## AI rule (absolute)

No Gemini call generates a quiz question or a live coaching answer anywhere in the product. The **only** permitted Gemini call converts a real recorded Guide session transcript into a session package, gated by Guide review before publish. All quest, duel, and diagnostic content is selected from a reviewed item bank, never generated live.

## Design system

| Token | Value | Use |
|-------|-------|-----|
| Primary violet | `#7C3AED` | Brand, CTAs |
| Indigo accent | `#6366F1` | Secondary brand |
| Dark navy shells | `#0B1220`, `#0F172A` | App backgrounds |
| Gold | `#D4A017` | **Verified truth only**: top rank, verified percentile number, Guide Impact Score badge. Never decorative. |
| Cyan | `#22D3EE` | Landing hero only |

Fonts: **Geist** and **Geist Mono** primary. **Playfair Display** reserved for the rank reveal moment only.

Copy: no emoji. No hyphens used as bullet markers. Concise copy, short sentences, no filler.

## Architecture

- Next.js App Router
- Vertical feature slices in `src/features/`
- Thin route shells under 15 lines in `src/app/`
- Supabase Postgres with RLS on every table
- Numbered migrations in `supabase/` — **never edit existing ones**, new migrations only
- Server actions as the mutation layer
- Vercel crons plus Postgres `background_jobs` queue for async work

## Rules

1. Never modify an existing migration
2. RLS enabled on every new table and any table that should need RLS
3. Every server action calls `requireAuth` or `requireRole`
4. Zod for all input validation
5. Regenerate types after every schema change (`npm run types:generate`)
6. Run tests after every change
7. No live Gemini call outside the one Studio transcript-to-package rule above
8. Every output ends in a **verdict sentence** and a **next action**, never a bare number or bare list
9. Gold color only on verified truth elements, never decorative, anywhere in the product

## Equal weight: Mentrixer and Guide

Mentrixer rank and Guide Impact Score are the same category of unforgeable proof. Guide Impact is measured first-attempt movement, not star ratings or likeability.

## Kill list (do not reintroduce)

- Screenshot-to-answer flows and free-text AI coaching surfaces
- Subjects outside AP Calculus AB in the practice picker (hidden until bar is met)
- Paywalling Arena, Mastery Grid, or public rank page
- Score panels that show a number without a verdict
